{"publicId":"5b20db19-e333-4d9f-b68e-1f28bc540183","title":"Vodafone完成英国收购并升级财务指引，Safaricom持股争议引关注","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T05:29:08.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-14T05:29:08.000Z","digest":"Vodafone集团宣布完成英国VodafoneThree全资收购（14亿英镑）及增持肯尼亚Safaricom至60%股份，上调全年收入预期至580亿英镑。财务升级基于英国业务协同效应显现（上半年成本降低2.4亿英镑）及非洲市场增长超预期（Safaricom Q2营收同比增18%）。但最新披露显示，Vodafone通过子公司Vodacom支付ZAR 35亿（约3.6亿英镑）完成15%股权收购，目前持股55%且案件仍在肯尼亚法院审理中，早前60%持股预期存在分歧。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-14T07:03:58.271Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Vodacom公布2026年上半年财报及Safaricom收购进展","latestReport":{"id":"gfxsta3h31920xyzxyr1hddho"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fHJAh9DEJ2B0","title":"Vodacom Group Limited Q2 2027 Earnings Call","firstReportAt":"2026-11-14T05:29:08.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"gfxsta3h31920xyzxyr1hddho","title":"Vodacom公布2026年上半年财报及Safaricom收购进展","summary":"Vodacom公布2026年上半年收入增长超预期，客户数达215亿，并披露Safaricom收购进展及投资金额。ZAR 35亿收购中包含向肯尼亚政府支付ZAR 26亿获得15%股权，向Vodafone支付ZAR 9亿增持至55%控股。目前案件仍在肯尼亚法院审理中。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T05:29:08.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"gfxsta3h31920xyzxyr1hddho","title":"Vodacom公布2026年上半年财报及Safaricom收购进展","summary":"Vodacom公布2026年上半年收入增长超预期，客户数达215亿，并披露Safaricom收购进展及投资金额。ZAR 35亿收购中包含向肯尼亚政府支付ZAR 26亿获得15%股权，向Vodafone支付ZAR 9亿增持至55%控股。目前案件仍在肯尼亚法院审理中。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T05:29:08.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","